Package: cigamingos-installer
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CiGaming <admin@snugglesmp.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: calamares, calamares-settings-debian, cigamingos-branding (= @VERSION@)
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: CiGaming OS graphical installer (Calamares branding)
 Brands the Calamares installer on the CiGaming OS live USB: name,
 logo, colors and the install slideshow. Only meant for live media.
